{"name": "friedmann_dark_fraction", "returns": "tuple[int, int]  # (num, den) of f_dark(a) reduced", "steps": [{"args": {"base": ["@row.a_num", "@row.a_den"], "exp": 4}, "class": "N", "op": "rational_pow_uint"}, {"args": {"a": ["@row.omega_c_num", "@row.omega_c_den"], "b": ["@row.a_num", "@row.a_den"]}, "class": "N", "op": "rational_mul"}, {"args": {"a": ["@row.omega_lambda_num", "@row.omega_lambda_den"], "b": "@step[0].output"}, "class": "N", "op": "rational_mul"}, {"args": {"a": "@step[1].output", "b": "@step[2].output"}, "class": "N", "op": "rational_add"}, {"args": {"a": ["@row.omega_b_num", "@row.omega_b_den"], "b": ["@row.a_num", "@row.a_den"]}, "class": "N", "op": "rational_mul"}, {"args": {"a": "@step[4].output", "b": "@step[1].output"}, "class": "N", "op": "rational_add"}, {"args": {"a": "@step[5].output", "b": "@step[2].output"}, "class": "N", "op": "rational_add"}, {"args": {"a": "@step[6].output", "b": ["@row.omega_r_num", "@row.omega_r_den"]}, "class": "N", "op": "rational_add"}, {"args": {"a": "@step[3].output", "b": "@step[7].output"}, "class": "N", "op": "rational_div"}], "summary": "Compute Friedmann dark-fraction f_dark(a) = (\u03a9_c\u00b7a + \u03a9_\u039b\u00b7a\u2074) / (\u03a9_b\u00b7a + \u03a9_c\u00b7a + \u03a9_\u039b\u00b7a\u2074 + \u03a9_r) as exact rational, composing rational_pow_uint + rational_mul + rational_add + rational_div over Planck-canonical \u03a9 values. Falsifies Q6.1 monotonicity claim row-by-row (Spike #27 PR #437)."}